  "details": "<p><span>An Akkadian inscription of Ninurta-kudurr\u012b-u\u1e63ur of Suhu states that that Suhean ruler intercepted a caravan of traders from Tema and Saba near the wells Martu and Halatu.\u00a0</span></p>",
